sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Manager/Employee
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Orders API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>UI: Create order
    UI->>API: POST /api/orders
    API->>DB: Validate customer
    DB-->>API: Customer exists
    API->>DB: Check product stock
    DB-->>API: Stock available
    API->>DB: Save order header
    API->>DB: Save order items
    API->>DB: Update inventory quantity
    DB-->>API: Order saved
    API-->>UI: Order created successfully
    UI-->>User: Show order summary and invoice status
